 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "放到一个具体场景里。交易所要接入一条新链。",
   "spoken": "放到一个具体场景里。交易所要接入一条新链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.488,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 5.255
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "照搬以太坊的接入逻辑，是假充值、错账和资金丢失的主要来源。",
   "spoken": "照搬以太坊的接入逻辑，是假充值、错账和资金丢失的主要来源。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-01.mp3",
   "start": 6.308,
   "dur": 6.576,
   "speechStart": 6.406,
   "speechEnd": 12.048
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "接入的人，先问这几件事。",
   "spoken": "接入的人，先问这几件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-02.mp3",
   "start": 13.104,
   "dur": 2.928,
   "speechStart": 13.202,
   "speechEnd": 15.202
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "失败的交易会不会上链，实际到账金额怎么读。",
   "spoken": "失败的交易会不会上链，实际到账金额怎么读。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.252,
   "dur": 4.584,
   "speechStart": 16.35,
   "speechEnd": 20.016
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "代币由什么唯一标识，合约地址、mint 地址、对象类型，还是 denom。有没有同名假币。",
   "spoken": "代币由什么唯一标识，合约地址、mint 地址、对象类型，还是 denom。有没有同名假币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-04.mp3",
   "start": 21.056,
   "dur": 8.304,
   "speechStart": 21.154,
   "speechEnd": 28.508
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "多少个区块之后不可回滚，历史上有没有停链。",
   "spoken": "多少个区块之后不可回滚，历史上有没有停链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-05.mp3",
   "start": 29.58,
   "dur": 4.44,
   "speechStart": 29.678,
   "speechEnd": 33.19
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "有没有两个独立运营的节点。现有的 HSM 和 MPC，支不支持这条链的签名算法。",
   "spoken": "有没有两个独立运营的节点。现有的 HSM 和 MPC，支不支持这条链的签名算法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-06.mp3",
   "start": 34.24,
   "dur": 7.416,
   "speechStart": 34.338,
   "speechEnd": 40.811
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "资产是否依赖链下索引器，用哪个版本，多个索引器的结果是否一致。",
   "spoken": "资产是否依赖链下索引器，用哪个版本，多个索引器的结果是否一致。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-07.mp3",
   "start": 41.876,
   "dur": 5.976,
   "speechStart": 41.974,
   "speechEnd": 46.997
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "链官方的 SDK 也是供应链。签名服务不要和业务代码共用依赖。",
   "spoken": "链官方的 SDK 也是公应链。签名服务不要和业务代码共用依赖。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-08.mp3",
   "start": 48.072,
   "dur": 6.528,
   "speechStart": 48.17,
   "speechEnd": 53.751
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "普通用户，跨链前确认代币的唯一标识，不只看名称。在 Solana 上签名时，看到陌生程序，不签。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，跨链前确认代币的唯一标识，不只看名称。在 Solana 上签名时，看到陌生程序，不签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-09.mp3",
   "start": 54.82,
   "dur": 9.384,
   "speechStart": 54.918,
   "speechEnd": 63.368
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。Solana 程序要读的账户，由谁提供？",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。Solana 程序要读的账户，由谁提供？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-10.mp3",
   "start": 64.424,
   "dur": 5.208,
   "speechStart": 64.522,
   "speechEnd": 68.793
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "由调用者在交易里传进来。所以程序必须自己核对每个账户的 owner、类型和地址。",
   "spoken": "由掉用者在交易里传进来。所以程序必须自己核对每个账户的 owner、类型和地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-11.mp3",
   "start": 70.132,
   "dur": 7.896,
   "speechStart": 70.23,
   "speechEnd": 77.192
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "这个答案只对 Solana 成立。换一条链，输入换了样子。",
   "spoken": "这个答案只对 Solana 成立。换一条链，输入换了样子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-12.mp3",
   "start": 78.248,
   "dur": 5.496,
   "speechStart": 78.346,
   "speechEnd": 82.891
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-13",
   "text": "要问的仍是同一个问题，谁决定这个输入可信。",
   "spoken": "要问的仍是同一个问题，谁决定这个输入可信。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-13.mp3",
   "start": 83.964,
   "dur": 4.152,
   "speechStart": 84.062,
   "speechEnd": 87.264
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-14",
   "text": "换一种账户模型，就换一组漏洞。",
   "spoken": "换一种账户模型，就换一组漏洞。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-14.mp3",
